.TH dalgona-plugin-help 1  "dalgona-plugin-help " 
.SH NAME
dalgona\-plugin\-help \- Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgona plugin help\fR [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
dalgona\-plugin\-help\-grant(1)
Grant the configured capabilities declared by NAME.
.TP
dalgona\-plugin\-help\-revoke(1)
Revoke every persistent grant for NAME.
.TP
dalgona\-plugin\-help\-list(1)
List configured plugins and their persistent grants.
.TP
dalgona\-plugin\-help\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
